  "translation": "Last weekend, I went to the park with a friend. The weather was very good, and we had a great time. We first took a walk by the lake, then sat on the grass to rest. There were many people there, some flying kites, some running. At noon, we had lunch at a small restaurant. In the afternoon, we went to the zoo and saw many animals. I like pandas the most, they are very cute. We took many photos, then took a car home. This day passed really fast, we were all very tired, but very happy."
